  "summary": "点带圈问号弹出小气泡，只放一段说明文字；点外部或 Esc 关闭。",
  "usage": "字段旁的解释入口，点开看 1–3 句说明（保留期、计费口径、权限含义这类说不清又必须交代的细节）。",
  "caution": "说明超过 5 行改用弹窗或侧栏；不要承载删除确认等危险操作。",
  "hint": "点问号查看说明",
  "prompt": "【问号说明气泡】目标：字段旁一个带圈的「?」，点击后在它下方弹出小气泡，气泡里只有一段说明文字，点外部或 Esc 关闭。用于「这个字段是什么意思」这类纯解释场景。\n\n1) 结构：.card（表单卡片：标题 + .row）里 .row = label + .q（18px 圆、1.5px 边框、问号居中）+ .value（当前值）。.pop 是绝对定位气泡：.pop-arrow（旋转 45° 的方块做小三角）+ 一段 <p> 说明文字。\n\n2) 气泡定位：getBoundingClientRect 取问号位置，left = 问号 left（夹在视口内），top = 问号 bottom + 8px；箭头 left = 问号中心 - 气泡 left。先 pop.classList.add('open') 再读 offsetWidth 定位，否则 display:none 时宽度为 0。\n\n3) 打开动画：el.animate 从 opacity 0 + translateY(-4px) scale(.97) 到归位，0.18 秒 ease-out；关闭直接 display:none。\n\n4) 交互：点问号 toggle、点外部关闭、Esc 关闭。气泡里只放说明文字，不要塞选项或按钮。\n\n5) 无障碍：问号加 aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" + aria-expanded；气泡 role=\"dialog\"；问号本身 aria-label（如「关于保留天数」）。\n\n6) 坑：气泡宽度固定（212px，卡片模式 186px），文字换行不撑宽；问号靠右时气泡会被裁，left 必须夹在 window.innerWidth - 宽度 - 12；卡片预览 176px 高，气泡 2–3 行文字 + 间距约 90px，放得下，但如果说明写到 5 行以上就得换弹窗。\n\n7) 配色：只用 --ui-* 变量；阴影 color-mix(in srgb,#000 14%,transparent)。\n\n8) 自动演示：只在 !window.__uiInteractive 时循环（光标点问号 → 气泡出现 → 1.9 秒后关闭 → 再 0.8 秒重来）；弹窗里只绑真实点击。\n\n9) 使用场景：字段解释、规则说明（1–3 句）。写进 usage / caution。",
  "demoHtml": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<style>\n*{box-sizing:border-box}\nhtml,body{height:100%}\nbody{margin:0;overflow:hidden;font-family:\"Segoe UI\",system-ui,\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif;color:var(--ui-text);background:var(--ui-bg);display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:16px}\n\n.card{width:340px;max-width:100%;border-radius:14px;background:var(--ui-surface);border:1px solid var(--ui-border);padding:14px 16px;box-shadow:0 8px 24px color-mix(in srgb,#000 6%,transparent)}\n.card h3{margin:0 0 10px;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ui-text)}\n\n.row{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;font-size:12px;color:var(--ui-text-dim)}\n.row label{color:var(--ui-text-dim)}\n\n.q{width:18px;height:18px;border-radius:50%;border:1.5px solid color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 28%,transparent);background:transparent;color:var(--ui-text-dim);\n  font-size:11px;font-weight:600;line-height:1;display:grid;place-items:center;cursor:pointer;padding:0;flex:0 0 auto;font-family:inherit;\n  transition:transform .12s ease,border-color .15s ease,color .15s ease}\n.q:hover,.q[aria-expanded=\"true\"]{border-color:var(--ui-brand);color:var(--ui-brand)}\n.q.pressing,.q:active{transform:scale(.9)}\n\n.value{font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ui-text);margin-left:2px}\n\n/* 说明气泡：只有文字，没有选项 */\n.pop{position:absolute;width:212px;background:var(--ui-surface);border:1px solid var(--ui-border);border-radius:12px;\n  box-shadow:0 12px 32px color-mix(in srgb,#000 14%,transparent);padding:12px 14px;display:none;z-index:30}\n.pop.open{display:block}\n.pop-arrow{position:absolute;top:-5px;width:9px;height:9px;background:var(--ui-surface);\n  border-left:1px solid var(--ui-border);border-top:1px solid var(--ui-border);transform:rotate(45deg)}\n.pop p{margin:0;font-size:11px;line-height:1.65;color:var(--ui-text-dim)}\n\n@media (max-height:420px){\n  body{padding:8px 10px}\n  .card{width:320px;padding:9px 11px;border-radius:11px}\n  .card h3{font-size:11px;margin:0 0 6px}\n  .row{font-size:11px}\n  .pop{width:186px;padding:9px 11px;border-radius:10px}\n  .pop p{font-size:10px;line-height:1.55}\n}\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){\n  .q{transition:none}\n}\n</style></head>\n<body>\n\n<div class=\"card\" id=\"card\">\n  <h3>回收站设置</h3>\n  <div class=\"row\">\n    <label>保留天数</label>\n    <button class=\"q\" id=\"q\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"关于保留天数\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" aria-expanded=\"false\">?</button>\n    <span class=\"value\">30 天</span>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pop\" id=\"pop\" role=\"dialog\" aria-label=\"保留天数说明\">\n  <span class=\"pop-arrow\" id=\"arrow\"></span>\n  <p>免费版保留 30 天，升级后保留 90 天；到期后自动清理，不可恢复。</p>\n</div>\n\n<script>\n(function(){\n  var q = document.getElementById('q'),\n      pop = document.getElementById('pop'),\n      arrow = document.getElementById('arrow');\n\n  var isOpen = false, timers = [], cursor = null, cursorReady = false;\n\n  function clearTimers(){\n    timers.forEach(function(t){ clearTimeout(t); });\n    timers = [];\n  }\n  function later(fn, ms){ timers.push(setTimeout(fn, ms)); }\n\n  function ensureCursor(){\n    if(cursorReady) return cursor;\n    cursorReady = true;\n    if(!window.__uiInteractive && typeof window.__uiDemoCursor === 'function'){\n      cursor = window.__uiDemoCursor();\n    }\n    return cursor;\n  }\n  function showCursor(){\n    if(cursor && cursor.el) cursor.el.classList.add('show');\n  }\n\n  function openPop(){\n    if(isOpen) return;\n    isOpen = true;\n    var r = q.getBoundingClientRect();\n    pop.classList.add('open');\n    var w = pop.offsetWidth;\n    var left = Math.max(8, Math.min(r.left, window.innerWidth - w - 12));\n    pop.style.left = left + 'px';\n    pop.style.top = (r.bottom + 8) + 'px';\n    if(arrow) arrow.style.left = (r.left + r.width / 2 - left) + 'px';\n    q.setAttribute('aria-expanded', 'true');\n    pop.animate(\n      [{opacity:0, transform:'translateY(-4px) scale(.97)'}, {opacity:1, transform:'none'}],\n      {duration:180, easing:'ease-out'}\n    );\n  }\n\n  function closePop(){\n    if(!isOpen) return;\n    isOpen = false;\n    pop.classList.remove('open');\n    q.setAttribute('aria-expanded', 'false');\n  }\n\n  q.addEventListener('click', function(e){\n    e.stopPropagation();\n    if(isOpen) closePop(); else openPop();\n  });\n\n  document.addEventListener('click', function(e){\n    if(!isOpen) return;\n    if(pop.contains(e.target) || q.contains(e.target)) return;\n    closePop();\n  });\n\n  document.addEventListener('keydown', function(e){\n    if(e.key === 'Escape') closePop();\n  });\n\n  function demoCycle(){\n    clearTimers();\n    closePop();\n    ensureCursor();\n\n    if(!cursor){\n      later(openPop, 500);\n      later(closePop, 2300);\n      later(demoCycle, 3000);\n      return;\n    }\n\n    showCursor();\n    cursor.moveTo(q);\n    later(function(){\n      cursor.press();\n      q.classList.add('pressing');\n      later(function(){\n        cursor.release();\n        q.classList.remove('pressing');\n        openPop();\n        later(function(){\n          if(typeof cursor.hide === 'function') cursor.hide();\n        }, 400);\n        later(closePop, 1900);\n        later(demoCycle, 2700);\n      }, 160);\n    }, 480);\n  }\n\n  if(window.__uiInteractive){\n    /* 弹窗：交互由用户自己点，不自动跑 */\n  } else {\n    setTimeout(demoCycle, 300);\n  }\n})();\n</script>\n</body></html>",
